<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64913" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάνης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ], ὁ</span>, a kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cup</i>, acc. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάνην</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).219
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				65
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				226
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				9
			</span></i> (Delos. <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Nico
				1
			</span></i>: nom. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάνητες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHib.</u>
					1.121.50
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>: but acc. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).110.22
				</span></i>
			 (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>small bronze figure</i> used in the game of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κότταβος</span> (q. v.), <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				55.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nicoch.
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> freq. in
			Com., as the name of a <i>Phrygian slave</i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				7.3.12
			</span></i>: generally, <i>slave</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				523
			</span></i>; applied to uncultured or dull people, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				965
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> a throw
			of the dice, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				59
			</span></i>.</div>
